&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaluza Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kaluza is the Energy Intelligence Platform, turning energy complexity into seamless coordination. We help energy companies overcome today’s challenges while accelerating the shift to a clean, electrified future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our platform orchestrates millions of real-time decisions across homes, devices, markets and grids. By combining predictive algorithms with human-centred design, Kaluza makes clean energy dependable, affordable and adaptive to everyday life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With teams across Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, and a joint venture with Mitsubishi Corporation in Japan, we power leading companies including OVO, AGL and ENGIE, as well as innovators like Volvo and Volkswagen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will I be doing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the People service desk queue day-to-day: triaging, responding to, and resolving employee queries, and keeping response times and queue health on track.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously improve our Jira Service Desk itself - refining triage, workflows, and automations - and feed recurring ticket themes back into our People Bot&#39;s knowledge base, so the answers people get before they ever need a human just keep getting better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the main point of contact for new joiners between offer and day one, partnering with Talent Acquisition to make pre-boarding seamless and ensuring nothing falls through the cracks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and continuously improve the onboarding experience end-to-end - from offer acceptance to day one and beyond - so every new hire feels genuinely welcomed and set up for success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support payroll inputs, benefits administration, and compliance activities, making sure our processes hold up against internal policy and employment law requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As you grow into the role: help audit and redesign People processes, identifying where automation, AI, or self-service can reduce manual effort and put information directly in employees&#39; hands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Roll up your sleeves on cross-functional People projects as they come up - whether that&#39;s a Reward cycle, a hiring initiative, or an experience improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ideally, you&#39;ll have/be:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some experience in a People Operations or HR administrative role, with a genuine interest in how operational rigour underpins the employee lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on comfort with a HRIS, ideally Workday - confident entering and updating records accurately as part of onboarding and lifecycle admin, even if deeper reporting and analysis isn&#39;t your focus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A naturally curious, detail-oriented approach to data - happy to flag something that looks off, even while you&#39;re still building the experience to know exactly why.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some exposure to payroll input processes, or strong eagerness to learn them, with the attention to detail accurate processing demands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some experience administering employee benefits (enrolment, changes, queries), and comfortable being a point of contact when something needs sorting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A habit of noticing when a process is clunky and saying so - you don&#39;t need to have led a full redesign yet, but you think about &lt;em&gt;why&lt;/em&gt; something works the way it does.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using a service desk tool (Jira or similar) to manage and triage a queue, with a good instinct for keeping things moving and knowing what needs escalating.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awareness of compliance and employment law basics, and the judgment to flag rather than guess when something feels off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, warm communication - equally comfortable writing to a nervous new joiner as flagging something to a manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;What will set you apart:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re curious about what AI and automation can do for People Operations, and you&#39;re already poking at tools and forming opinions rather than waiting to be told to explore what&#39;s next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You hold yourself to a high bar, and you&#39;ll say so if you think something could be better - even if you&#39;re not yet the one leading the fix.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You share what you know and keep people in the loop - a new joiner never feels like they&#39;re chasing you for answers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
